Third-party notices for the jobwatch browser extension

page.js follows two open-source job-application autofill extensions in places. Their code is not
copied wholesale; the approaches below were read there and rewritten as plain JavaScript. Their
licenses are kept here as they ask.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
job_app_filler  https://github.com/berellevy/job_app_filler   (BSD-3-Clause)

Used for: opening a Greenhouse board's react-select menu through the React handler on its trigger
element when synthetic mouse events don't open it; handing React the new value through the input's
own onChange when it reverts a typed value; handing a React upload its file through the file input's
onChange when the page doesn't show the file after a change event.

