Autofill-Jobs  https://github.com/andrewmillercode/Autofill-Jobs   (MIT)

Used for: the field names and ids Greenhouse and Lever forms use (candidate-location,
hispanic_ethnicity, veteran_status, urls[LinkedIn], eeo[gender], resume-upload-input), which the
field detection in logic.js and page.js reads as hints; the idea of reading id, name, placeholder,
aria-label and data-qa together; and attaching a resume with DataTransfer and a change event.

